      "text": "KEY INTERVIEW TRUTHS\\n\\n- compiled code is shared\\n- WASI mutable memory is fresh\\n- handler memory is cooperatively reset\\n- wasmdee.invoke bypasses HTTP\\n- worker scaling is local, not cluster scaling\\n- no true snapshot / CoW restore yet",
